---
source: text/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"line\")"
---
Read one line from standard input and write it to standard output.

Exits with status 0 if a whole line was read. If the input ends before a newline, line still writes
a newline and exits with status 1.

Usage: line

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
